    <string name="confession_mic_disclosure">Creativitism can listen while you say the confession sentence so you do not have to type it.\n\nAudio is processed by Android\'s speech recognition and is never stored or uploaded by Creativitism. If on-device recognition is unavailable, the platform speech service may process audio transiently.\n\nYou can always type the sentence instead.</string>
